                "If a district office collapses, complaints and new visits transfer to the nearest operating office. Visitors en route switch to regular intake; deadlines and district statistics stay intact. Rallies bypass the collapsed office and head to City Hall. Chirper announces office closures and the need to repair or reassign them.",
